{"id":701,"name":"hawlucha","speciesId":701,"dex":701,"form":"normal","generation":6,"types":["fighting","flying"],"stats":{"hp":78,"attack":92,"defense":75,"special-attack":74,"special-defense":63,"speed":118},"abilities":[{"name":"limber","hidden":false},{"name":"unburden","hidden":false},{"name":"mold-breaker","hidden":true}],"height":8,"weight":215,"baseExp":175,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/701.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/701.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/701.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/701.ogg","genus":"Wrestling Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"x","text":"Although its body is small, its proficient fighting skills enable it to keep up with big bruisers like Machamp and Hariyama."},{"version":"y","text":"With its wings, it controls its position in the air. It likes to attack from above, a maneuver that is difficult to defend against."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"It overwhelms opponents with quick moves, but sometimes it showboats for too long when it’s using a special move and gets itself into a pinch."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"In combat, Hawlucha leaps nimbly about, taking advantage of its opponents’ blind spots. It’s also skilled at using superb submission holds."},{"version":"sword","text":"It drives its opponents to exhaustion with its agile maneuvers, then ends the fight with a flashy finishing move."},{"version":"shield","text":"It always strikes a pose before going for its finishing move. Sometimes opponents take advantage of that time to counterattack."}],"genderRate":4,"captureRate":100,"eggGroups":["flying","humanshape"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"hawlucha","speciesId":701,"evolvesTo":[]},"varieties":[{"id":701,"name":"ha